  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsible Forestry Project Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.The proposed project readiness financing (PRF), Responsible Forestry Project Phase I (RFPP1), will support the Department of Forestry (DOF) under the Ministry of Agriculture and Environment (MAE) of Lao People&amp;apos;s Democratic Republic (PDR) in advancing the preparation of the ensuing Responsible Forestry Project (RFP). To ensure a high level of project readiness of the ensuing project loan and to test the project&amp;apos;s innovative approach, the PRF will (i) conduct upstream sector assessment and policy studies, surveys, consultations, and preparation of feasibility studies, due diligence, and detailed technical designs for investment activities; (ii) pilot innovative models for publicprivate-community (PPC) participation in commercial forest plantation and conservation; and (iii) provide capacity building support to government&amp;apos;s agencies across central and local levels, as well as communities engaged in the ensuing project&amp;apos;s activities</narrative>
  </description>
